#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-se.rst:72
#: f4794adea6cd472b821b9577df076037
msgid "Default UART order"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-se.rst:74
#: b4e3b61d55174544aefada474fe737e9
msgid "SERIAL0 = console = USB"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-se.rst:75
#: f3fcee01df334fd5999236b25efb012f
msgid "SERIAL1 = Telemetry1 = USART1"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-se.rst:76
#: d679ad00342242d887dd4d80517e2fce
msgid "SERIAL2 = empty"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-se.rst:77
#: 98e28745271c496f8339b9c618891f57
msgid "SERIAL3 = GPS1 = USART3"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-se.rst:78
#: c8cd2a869e1741778b5d39d222f7e030
msgid "SERIAL4 = GPS2 = UART4"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-se.rst:79
#: 2f0e0931585c4a22821f39caaba19721
msgid "SERIAL5 = USER = UART5"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-se.rst:80
#: 047740184b964303a798eeed059964d1
msgid "SERIAL6 = USER = USART6 (RX only; for ESC telemetry, use SERIAL6_PROTOCOL=16)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-se.rst:81
#: abc12772adff42609461fd045d73a3b9
msgid "SERIAL7 = USER = USART2 (only if BRD_ALT_CONFIG =1)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-se.rst:83
#: 599e157dd94540018ebc9f669e0bdb1a
msgid "Serial protocols can be adjusted to personal preferences."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-se.rst:86
#: 93e5840851314bb9bc3f43497cbf684f
msgid "Dshot capability"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-se.rst:88
#: d148c9da3b7b40c98359ee0c7f8b3016
msgid "All motor/servo outputs are Dshot and PWM capable. However, mixing Dshot and normal PWM operation for outputs is restricted into groups, ie. enabling Dshot for an output in a group requires that ALL outputs in that group be configured and used as Dshot, rather than PWM outputs. The output groups that must be the same (PWM rate or Dshot, when configured as a normal servo/motor output) are: 1/2, 3/4, 5/6, 7/8, 9 , and 10."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-se.rst:91
#: 5fc03e405f3e4ee6b0d59e60b8386e93
msgid "Outputs"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-se.rst:93
#: 84c682a81c4b4b3e8385be0a4b9cdb89
msgid "The first 8 servo/motor outputs are marked on the board: M1,M2,S3-S8 . S9 is a solder pad on the board, and S10 is connected to the pin marked LED in ArduPilot's definition. Using S10 allows the easy grouping for odd numbers of motors with a common DShot or PWM frequency without sacrificing the use of an output for servo use due to rate issues (see above Dshot discussion)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-se.rst:97
#: 2d6429ee88b441aa9b5a7342eea5ceab
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-se.rst:99
#: 8e0b0560e92e4a24beeba3891b574163
msgid "The SBUS pin, is passed by an inverter to R2 (UART2 RX), which by default is mapped to a timer input instead of the UART, and can be used for all ArduPilot supported receiver protocols, except CRSF/ELRS and SRXL2 which require a true UART connection. However, FPort, when connected in this manner, will only provide RC without telemetry."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-se.rst:101
#: d8e419bfa7e04c3a858e3eb19ffe829f
msgid "To allow CRSF and embedded telemetry available in Fport, CRSF, and SRXL2 receivers, the R2 pin can also be configured to be used as true UART2 RX pin for use with bi-directional systems by setting the :ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` to “1” so it becomes the SERIAL7 port's RX input pin."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-se.rst:103
#: 89ce15d1a525464bab0a52f64bdcd6d8
msgid "With this option, :ref:`SERIAL7_PROTOCOL<SERIAL7_PROTOCOL>` must be set to \"23\", and:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-se.rst:105
#: 41c8349c0e6f485b8f03f48b7d773339
msgid "PPM is not supported."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-se.rst:107
#: 118d6b1fdec64e6a8b63dda925d409aa
msgid "DSM/SRXL connects to the R2  pin, but SBUS would still be connected to SBUS."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-se.rst:109
#: de05899671674e3e9a924d10cf15a779
msgid "FPort requires connection to T2 and R2 via a bi-directional inverter. See :ref:`common-FPort-receivers`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-se.rst:111
#: 559e10ee428a4623a2db40112d99b345
msgid "CRSF also requires a T2 connection, in addition to R2, and automatically provides telemetry."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-se.rst:113
#: 48a677b380904acea0d39a3e7953e184
msgid "SRXL2 requires a connection to T2 and automatically provides telemetry.  Set :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` to \"4\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-se.rst:115
#: 3d15f028494c408ead0b4306a4fc790e
msgid "Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also, and is compatible with all protocols except PPM (SBUS requires external inversion on other UARTs). See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for details."
msgstr ""

